# Headings with payloads {#h-payloads}

# <script>alert(1)</script>

# `<svg onload=alert(1)>`

# **<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>**

# *<iframe srcdoc="<script>alert(1)</script>">*

## Encoded `&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;`

## Mixed `<<<>>>` brackets

## RTL Override: ‮

# Inline link payloads

[click](javascript:alert(1))

[click](JAVASCRIPT:alert(1))

[click](ja&#x76;ascript:alert(1))

[click](ja%76ascript:alert(1))

[click](javascript%3aalert(1))

[click](data:text/html,<script>alert(1)</script>)

[click](data:application/xhtml+xml,<html/>)

[click](data:image/svg+xml,<svg onload=alert(1)/>)

[click](vbscript:alert(1))

[click](file:///etc/passwd)

[click](jar:https://example.test/x.jar!/)

[click](chrome://settings)

[click](about:blank)

[click](\\server\share)

