# Style payloads

:::style
body { color: red; }</style><script>alert(1)</script>
:::

:::style
.x { background-image: url(javascript:alert(1)); }
:::

:::style
.x { content: "\3c script\3e alert(1)\3c /script\3e "; }
:::

